10:Tabb,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『キングダム』","description":"累計発行部数1億部を突破する原泰久の大人気コミック、初の舞台化作品。2023年2月に帝国劇場にて開幕し、全国4都市で上演された。主人公・信役の三浦宏規／高野洸をはじめ、嬴政・漂役の小関裕太／牧島輝など、主要キャストに豪華Wキャストを起用。パルクールや本格的な殺陣を駆使したド迫力のアクションと、オーケストラの生演奏が融合し、春秋戦国時代の苛烈な戦乱と若者たちの熱きドラマを帝劇史上最大級のスケールで描き出した。2026年秋には、同じく帝国劇場ほかにて待望の続編『キングダムII -継承-』の上演が決定している。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/kingdom-stage","keywords":"アクション濃いめ, 漫画原作, 群像・チーム感, 殺陣厚め","about":"舞台『キングダム』","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"三浦 宏規","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/miura-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"高野 洸","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takano-akira"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小関 裕太","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/koseki-yuta"},{"@type":"Person","name":"牧島 輝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/makishima-hikaru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"川島 海荷","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kawashima-umika"},{"@type":"Person","name":"華 優希","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hana-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"梅澤 美波","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/umezawa-minami"},{"@type":"Person","name":"美弥 るりか","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/miya-rurika"},{"@type":"Person","name":"有澤 樟太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/arisawa-shotaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"梶 裕貴","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kaji-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 大河","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-taiga"},{"@type":"Person","name":"神里 優希","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kamisato-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"早乙女 友貴","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/saotome-yuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"元木 聖也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/motoki-seiya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"朴 璐美","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/park-romi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"石川 由依","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ishikawa-yui"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小西 遼生（小西大樹）","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/konishi-ryosei"},{"@type":"Person","name":"山口 祐一郎","url":"https://st